  "boundaries": [
    "Each modified ClientConnectionRunner creates its own FloodfillNetworkDatabaseFacade and transient contact DB. LookupDestJob resolves the calling connection DB; no cross-client local lookup bypass was found.",
    "ClientManager.distributeMessage sends to a different actual locally registered Destination via DistributeLocal; no public tunnel routing is needed for this bounded exchange.",
    "Only an actually accepted/current signature-verified tracker LS2 may be copied with the public store into the owned native client DB; this is explicit warmed-cache fixture setup, not discovery.",
    "Native opaque Destination Enc0 bytes are original format; its current signed LS2 supplies the separately generated genuine independent encryption keypair."
  ]
